        "label": "THE FINAL TWIST"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "So wake up. No alarm rings. Your phone says no signal, no messages, nothing. You step outside, and the whole street is silent.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "dormitorio",
        "hora": "dia",
        "mood": "worried",
        "objeto": "movil",
        "label": "NO SIGNAL"
      },
      "camera": "static",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "No cars. No voices. Not even a barking dog. Just you, and an entire planet with nobody left to share it.",
