        "label": "MYTH #1"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "flash"
    },
    {
      "capitulo": "Chapter 2 · Power and Wheels",
      "text": "Myth one: you'd have free electricity forever. Every light on, air conditioning blasting, every screen in the city glowing just for you.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "salon",
        "hora": "dia",
        "mood": "happy",
        "objeto": "taza",
        "label": "Free power forever"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the movies, the hero flips one switch and a whole skyscraper lights up like a Christmas tree. Easy, right?",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "medio",
        "mood": "happy",
        "piezas": [
