            "anim": "latir"
          }
        ],
        "label": "The Hollywood version"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's the reality. Power plants need people. Operators and engineers adjust the output and balance the grid every single minute of the day.",
      "scene": "document",
      "params": {
        "title": "Grid Manual",
        "lines": [
          "Balance supply",
          "Adjust output",
          "Check the lines",
          "Staff on duty: 0"
        ],
        "highlight": 3,
        "stamp": "NO STAFF"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "Without them, supply and demand drift apart. Safety systems trip, lines disconnect, and whole sections of the grid shut down automatically.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "calle",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "semaforo",
