          {
            "pieza": "rayo",
            "pos": "arriba_derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "temblar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Safety systems trip"
      },
      "camera": "shake",
      "transition": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within hours to a few days, most of the grid goes dark. City by city, block by block, light by light.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "noche",
        "plano": "sin_persona",
        "label": "Lights out, block by block"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nuclear reactors shut themselves down safely, but they still need power for cooling. Gas and coal plants run out of fuel deliveries.",
