          }
        ],
        "label": "Plants shut down"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Only a few sources could last longer, like dams. At Hoover Dam in Nevada, falling water keeps spinning giant turbines, at least for a while.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "desierto",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "montana_pieza",
