      },
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "text": "But with no grid to carry that power and nobody to control it, even those turbines would eventually trip and fall silent.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "desierto",
        "hora": "noche",
