        "mood": "shocked",
        "objeto": "linterna",
        "label": "Stars everywhere"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your freezer warms up. Your phone dies by tomorrow. The dream of free electricity lasts about as long as a long weekend.",
