            "tamano": "mediano"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "vaso_agua",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Canned: years"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dry rice, pasta, and beans last even longer if you keep them dry. A smart survivor raids the canned aisle first, not the bakery.",
      "scene": "accion",
      "params": {
        "tipo": "comer",
        "objeto": "lata_conserva",
        "lugar": "cocina",
        "hora": "dia",
        "label": "Cans first"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "And then there's honey. Because it's so low in moisture and naturally acidic, honey basically never spoils. Jars from ancient Egyptian tombs were reportedly still edible.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "desierto",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "vaso_agua",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "flotar"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "piramide",
            "pos": "fondo",
            "tamano": "grande"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Honey never spoils"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "So you wouldn't starve right away. But the clock is ticking, because every can you open is one you can never replace.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "cocina",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "persona": "medio",
        "mood": "worried",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "reloj_arena",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "girar"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "vaso_agua",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "mediano"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Cans run out"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eventually you'd have to farm, fish, or forage. And a person raised on delivery apps has never done that alone.",
