      "params": {
        "tipo": "crecer",
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "dia",
        "label": "Grow it yourself"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "But if you think food is hard, wait until you see what happens to the city itself. That's the next myth.",
