      "params": {
        "tipo": "dudar",
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "label": "Next: the city"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "capitulo": "Chapter 4 · The Intact City",
      "text": "Myth four: cities would look just like the movie, intact. Gleaming skyscrapers, clean streets, everything waiting for you to explore.",
