            "tamano": "gigante"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Gleaming skyline"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reality: a city is a machine that only works because thousands of people fix it every day. Stop, and nature takes over.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "edificio",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "grande"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "arbol",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "crecer"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "hormiga",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "pequeno",
            "anim": "entrar_der"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Nature takes over"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take New York. Its subway runs below the water table, and pumps remove about thirteen million gallons of water every single day.",
      "scene": "map_pin",
      "params": {
        "style": "calles",
        "place": "New York City",
        "detail": "About 13 million gallons pumped daily"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "text": "Those pumps need electricity. When the grid dies, the water starts to rise, quietly, in the dark, under your feet.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "fondo",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "ola_gigante",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "gigante",
            "anim": "crecer"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "gota",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "caer"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Pumps need power"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_down",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some estimates say that parts of the tunnels could flood in about thirty-six hours. A day and a half, and the subway becomes a river.",
      "scene": "calendar",
      "params": {
        "style": "pared",
        "month": "Hour",
        "day": "36",
        "label": "Tunnels flooding"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about that. Thirty-six hours from silence to a flooded underground. And the ground above would start to weaken.",
      "scene": "big_text",
      "params": {
        "text": "36 HOURS",
        "color": "#ff4d4d",
        "label": "From silence to flooded",
        "lugar": "ciudad"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above the surface, rain does the rest. Gutters clog, roofs leak, and plants push up through every tiny crack in the pavement.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "calle",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "nube",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "flotar"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "gota",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "caer"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "arbol",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "crecer"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Rain does the rest"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_down",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within a few years, trees grow through sidewalks. Within decades, bridges rust and many buildings begin to collapse. Within centuries, a forest.",
      "scene": "year_jump",
      "params": {
        "from": "2025",
        "to": "2525",
        "label": "Centuries later"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Writer Alan Weisman explored this in his book The World Without Us. His conclusion: cities decay much faster than anyone expects.",
      "scene": "document",
      "params": {
        "title": "The World Without Us",
        "lines": [
          "By Alan Weisman",
          "Cities decay fast",
          "Nature takes over"
        ],
        "highlight": 1,
        "stamp": "BOOK"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "So that perfect, intact skyline from the movies? It's a snapshot. It lasts for days, not for years.",
      "scene": "newspaper",
      "params": {
        "style": "papel",
        "headline": "Perfect Skyline Lasts Days",
        "kicker": "Hollywood Daily",
        "date": "Never"
      },
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "text": "And yet, none of this is the biggest danger. The next myth is the one most people get completely backwards.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "calle",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "plano": "entero",
        "mood": "worried",
        "arms": "cross",
        "label": "Next: the real danger"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "capitulo": "Chapter 5 · The Real Danger",
      "text": "Myth five: the real danger is wild animals. Lions, wolves, maybe a bear wandering through an empty shopping mall.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "persona": "medio",
        "mood": "shocked",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "leon",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "entrar_izq"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "oso",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "acercarse"
          }
        ],
        "label": "MYTH #5"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hollywood loves this one. Zoo animals escape, predators roam downtown, and you spend the whole movie hiding in a locked car.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "coche",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "medio",
        "mood": "worried",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "leon",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "acercarse"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Hiding in a car"
      },
      "camera": "shake",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reality: many pets and zoo animals wouldn't survive long. And most wild animals avoid humans anyway. They aren't hunting you.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "perro",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "entrar_izq"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "pajaro",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "pequeno",
            "anim": "flotar"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "gato",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Most animals avoid you"
      },
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "The real hazards are boring ones. An infected cut, food poisoning, a broken ankle with no doctor for a thousand miles.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "montana",
        "hora": "dia",
        "plano": "entero",
        "mood": "sad",
        "highlight": "legs",
        "label": "Broken ankle, no doctor"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "One small injury could be deadly. No ambulance, no hospital, no phone number to call. Every decision is entirely yours.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "hospital",
        "hora": "noche",
        "plano": "sin_persona",
        "label": "Empty hospital"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "But the biggest threat of all isn't a lion. It's the silence. It's loneliness.",
      "scene": "accion",
      "params": {
        "tipo": "llorar",
        "lugar": "calle",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "label": "Loneliness"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Humans are social animals. Our brains evolved to live in groups, and long-term isolation changes how our bodies actually work.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "fondo",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "cerebro",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "gigante",
            "anim": "latir"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "corazon",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "latir"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Built for company"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Studies link chronic social isolation to health risks comparable to smoking fifteen cigarettes a day. Fifteen. Every day.",
      "scene": "big_text",
      "params": {
        "text": "15 CIGARETTES",
        "color": "#ffd400",
        "label": "A DAY",
        "lugar": "salon"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "That means higher risk of heart disease, depression, bad sleep, and early death. Loneliness isn't just sad. It's measurable.",
      "scene": "accion",
      "params": {
        "tipo": "latido",
        "label": "Higher health risks"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember Tom Hanks talking to a volleyball in Cast Away? That wasn't a joke. It's what a lonely brain does to survive.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "playa",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "persona": "medio",
        "mood": "sad",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "barca",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "flotar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Talking to a volleyball"
      },
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "So you'd need routines. Wake at the same hour, keep a journal, exercise, read, build something every single day.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "dormitorio",
        "hora": "dia",
        "plano": "medio",
        "mood": "happy",
        "objeto": "libro",
        "label": "Routine: journal and exercise"
      },
      "camera": "static",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because surviving isn't just food and water. It's staying human when nobody is left to remind you what that means.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "atardecer",
        "plano": "entero",
        "mood": "neutral",
        "arms": "normal",
        "label": "Stay human"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some nights you'd probably scream into an empty plaza. And the only answer would be your own echo.",
      "scene": "accion",
      "params": {
        "tipo": "gritar",
        "lugar": "ciudad",
        "hora": "noche",
        "label": "Only your echo"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "black"
    },
    {
      "capitulo": "Chapter 6 · The Twist",
      "text": "Now let's go back to the question, because I've been tricking you this whole video. Here's what no movie tells you.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "espacio",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "tierra",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "gigante",
            "anim": "girar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Wait..."
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "You pictured being the last human. But the question was the last person ON Earth. That's not the same thing.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "playa",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "entero",
        "mood": "worried",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "tierra",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "girar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "ON Earth, not the last human"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Right now, there are usually around ten people orbiting above you, aboard the International Space Station and China's Tiangong station.",
      "scene": "space",
      "params": {
        "object": "planet",
        "color": "#2f6fdb",
        "ring": false
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "They float roughly two hundred fifty miles up, circling the planet every ninety minutes. They would watch every city go dark from above.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "espacio",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "telescopio",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "entrar_der"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "tierra",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "gigante",
            "anim": "girar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "About 10 people in orbit"
      },
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "And here's the best part. Their capsules are built to bring them home. Soyuz, Dragon, and Shenzhou can all carry crews back to Earth.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "espacio",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "cohete",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "acercarse"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "tierra",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "grande"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Soyuz, Dragon, Shenzhou"
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with mission control silent, those capsules can in principle fly largely on their own, with parachutes doing the final braking.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "desierto",
        "hora": "dia",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "astronauta",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "caer"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "nube",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "flotar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Parachutes slow the landing"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_down",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, down here, you sit under a black sky. Then one night, you notice a bright dot gliding across the stars.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "montana",
        "hora": "noche",
        "plano": "medio",
        "mood": "worried",
        "objeto": "linterna",
        "label": "A bright dot"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't blink like an airplane. It moves fast and steady. The space station is one of the brightest objects in the night sky.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "fondo",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "estrella",
            "pos": "izquierda",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "latir"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "telescopio",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "grande",
            "anim": "entrar_izq"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "avion",
            "pos": "derecha",
            "tamano": "pequeno",
            "anim": "flotar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Steady, not blinking"
      },
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "transition": "whip"
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine realizing that dot isn't a satellite. It's people. Someone looking back at you. Someone who might be coming home.",
      "scene": "accion",
      "params": {
        "tipo": "sorpresa",
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "noche",
        "label": "That's people up there"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "So the truth is, the last person on Earth might not be alone for long. Hollywood forgot about everyone looking down.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "noche",
        "persona": "entero",
        "mood": "happy",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "telescopio",
            "pos": "arriba",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "flotar"
          }
        ],
        "label": "Someone coming home"
      },
      "camera": "pull_out",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "So tonight, when the sky gets dark, look up. Someone might be landing to find you.",
      "scene": "escena",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "campo",
        "hora": "noche",
        "plano": "entero",
        "mood": "happy",
        "arms": "up",
        "label": "Look up"
      },
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell me in the comments: which myth surprised you most? And would you have picked the Ferrari or the bicycle?",
      "scene": "phone",
      "params": {
        "screen": "chat",
        "chat": {
          "contact": "The Curio Lab",
          "status": "online",
          "typing": true,
          "messages": [
            {
              "from": "them",
              "text": "Which myth surprised you most?"
            },
            {
              "from": "them",
              "text": "Ferrari or bicycle?"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "camera": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you enjoyed this, watch our next video, where we ask what would happen if the Moon suddenly disappeared tomorrow.",
      "scene": "composicion",
      "params": {
        "lugar": "espacio",
        "persona": "no",
        "piezas": [
          {
            "pieza": "luna",
            "pos": "centro",
            "tamano": "gigante",
            "anim": "flotar"
          },
          {
            "pieza": "estrella",
            "pos": "arriba_derecha",
            "tamano": "mediano",
            "anim": "latir"
          }
        ],
        "label": "NEXT: No Moon?"
      },
      "camera": "slam",
      "transition": "fade"
    }
  ],
